,{"type":"h","text":"Practical Scenario"},{"type":"note","label":"Situation","text":"A Class 9 group has significant differences in language proficiency. Some students understand advanced literature easily, while others struggle with basic grammar."},{"type":"p","text":"A good teacher should:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Assess individual learning gaps."},{"text":"Divide students according to learning needs where appropriate."},{"text":"Provide differentiated learning material."},{"text":"Reinforce fundamental grammar."},{"text":"Use progressively difficult texts."},{"text":"Conduct formative assessments."},{"text":"Provide additional support to struggling students."},{"text":"Give advanced students enrichment activities."},{"text":"Track progress."},{"text":"Adjust teaching strategies based on results."}]},{"type":"h","text":"Government Teaching Route"},{"type":"p","text":"Government opportunities may exist through:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"State education departments"},{"text":"Central schools"},{"text":"State schools"},{"text":"Government colleges"},{"text":"Universities"},{"text":"Language academies"},{"text":"Public educational institutions"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For school teaching, eligibility may involve combinations of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Relevant degree"},{"text":"B.Ed"},{"text":"Teacher Eligibility Test"},{"text":"Recruitment examination"},{"text":"Subject-specific requirements"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For college/university teaching, requirements can involve:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Relevant master's degree"},{"text":"NET/SET or applicable exemption"},{"text":"PhD depending on the post and prevailing rules"},{"text":"Institution-specific recruitment criteria"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Exact requirements change by post and recruiting authority, so the current notification should always be checked."}]},{"heading":"Postgraduate Study in India","kind":"pg_india","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Strongest Path for Teaching"},{"type":"flow","items":["BA Hindi/Regional Language","MA Hindi/Regional Language","NET/SET where applicable","Assistant Professor / PhD pathway"]},{"type":"p","text":"Useful master's programmes:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"MA Hindi"},{"text":"MA Telugu"},{"text":"MA Tamil"},{"text":"MA Kannada"},{"text":"MA Malayalam"},{"text":"MA Marathi"},{"text":"MA Bengali"},{"text":"MA Gujarati"},{"text":"MA Punjabi"},{"text":"MA Odia"},{"text":"MA Urdu"},{"text":"MA Linguistics"},{"text":"MA Comparative Literature"},{"text":"MA Translation Studies"}]},{"type":"h","text":"For School Teaching"},{"type":"flow","items":["BA","B.Ed","applicable TET/recruitment requirements","Teacher"]},{"type":"p","text":"The exact sequence can vary according to the target school system and recruitment rules."}]},{"heading":"Study Abroad","kind":"abroad","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"For students interested in language research, comparative literature, linguistics, education, or South Asian studies, potential destinations include:"},{"type":"table","header":["Country","Relevant Areas"],"rows":[[{"text":"USA"},{"text":"South Asian Studies, Linguistics, Education"}],[{"text":"UK"},{"text":"Linguistics, Literature, Education"}],[{"text":"Canada"},{"text":"Education, Linguistics, South Asian Studies"}],[{"text":"Australia"},{"text":"Education, Linguistics"}],[{"text":"Germany"},{"text":"Linguistics, Indology"}],[{"text":"France"},{"text":"Indian Languages, Comparative Literature"}],[{"text":"Netherlands"},{"text":"Linguistics, Language Studies"}],[{"text":"Singapore"},{"text":"Asian Studies, Linguistics"}]]},{"type":"p","text":"Possible master's/research areas:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Linguistics"},{"text":"Applied Linguistics"},{"text":"Comparative Literature"},{"text":"South Asian Studies"},{"text":"Language Education"},{"text":"Translation Studies"},{"text":"Digital Humanities"},{"text":"Education"}]}]},{"heading":"Career Progression","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"h","text"